From b80333273b4cc39fa5f6c5861381e18068e779ae Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: reaper <theunbounddeveloper@outlook.com>
Date: Wed, 8 Jul 2026 13:13:00 -0400
Subject: [PATCH] webui: repoint + rebrand AiDisk entry points to 'USB / File
 Sharing' (Phase 1.4)

The wizard aidisk.asp is deleted; its three entry points now open the kept
Advanced_AiDisk_samba.asp management page instead, rebranded per owner choice:
- device-map/disk.asp: network-map USB-panel button gotoAidisk() -> samba page;
  label token AiDiskWizard rebranded (EN.dict) 'AiDisk Wizard' -> 'USB / File Sharing'
  (disk.asp is the sole remaining consumer after the wizard pages were removed).
- APP_Installation.asp: the app tile 'AiDisk'/aidisk.asp -> 'USB / File Sharing'/
  Advanced_AiDisk_samba.asp; the two getIndexByValue2D('AiDisk') removal-guards
  updated to the new name so AP/repeater-mode hiding still works.
- require/menuTrees/menuTree.js: dropped the aidisk.asp tab from menu_APP and the
  dead BUSINESS-only retArray push. Edited menuTrees/ (the file that ships for
  RT-BE96U); modules/ is overwritten from it at build (www/Makefile:916).
- js/faq.js: aiDisk FAQ link -> Advanced_AiDisk_samba.asp.
EN.dict edit verified ASCII-only. state.js:2369 aidisk.asp margin branch left
(dead, never matches). Menu tabs (Samba/FTP/NFS Share) were never 'AiDisk'-branded
so unchanged; kept-page headings read 'USB Application - ...' (menu5_4).
---
 release/src/router/www/APP_Installation.asp          | 6 +++---
 release/src/router/www/EN.dict                       | 2 +-
 release/src/router/www/device-map/disk.asp           | 2 +-
 release/src/router/www/js/faq.js                     | 2 +-
 release/src/router/www/require/menuTrees/menuTree.js | 2 --
 5 files changed, 6 insertions(+), 8 deletions(-)

